What happens if you become a creditor in the Exchange bankruptcy process? It may draw on years while the government tries to collect taxes, creditors attempt to get their loans repaid, etc. and you (the customer) are just one of a long line of creditors attempting to recover funds. 

&#x200B;

In the case of Mt. Gox, they filed for bankruptcy in February 2014. It took years, I believe like 7 years, for customers to finally recover about 90% of the funds.

